riority note**: HLR-3 is P2 but is renewal-blocking for two customers per\n72\t  the problem statement; the strategy's P2 label may understate its urgency.\n73\t  Flagged for human verification; priorities kept as stated.\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a40f55888b7abdf6","agent_id":"a635cd8cfa9635a3b","session_id":"1febe4f8-5e51-4ce2-ab64-e380dbc0e05c","uuid":"cfe7c67c-2a5a-47ea-bacb-b346d35240bb","timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:06:10.433Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-830cae9396a788f3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
